The mobile app Prizrak ID was designed for users of the car immobilizer systems Prizrak ID and telematics car alarm systems Prizrak 8 and 8-xx series. The mobile app Prizrak ID allows the registered users to pass authentication in order to enable the vehicle's engine to start before driving.  After installing this application on your smartphone, it turns into  a part of the vehicle anti-theft system. The Prizrak ID app - is a smartphone tag that you always carry with you.

Features:
- runs in the background mode;
- the app users don't have to follow additional actions;
- is compatible with iPhones based on IOS version not lower than IOS 12.

The firmware version of the Prizrak system must be v328 and higher to ensure proper operation of the mobile application with IOS 13.

